      "exactBehavior": "File-size editor exposes five exclusive comparison radios (<,≈,=,≠,>) with clamped arrow navigation, Space and the default Enter path. Amount clamps to 0–1,048,576 and B/KB/MB/GB/TB remain separated binary units; selecting a unit does not convert the amount. Typed values reach the existing query executor with actual Qt hash outcomes for all operator/unit combinations and equality boundaries. Explicit supplied-value reconstruction preserves raw units in the model; native saved-default units persist/reopen and preserve unrelated default families. Cancel leaves the search unchanged. Hidden child/main or pending main questions refuse edits/acceptance; rebind and accepted exit cancel the owned main child, declined exit stays live, and a refused activation is consumed rather than resurrected later.",
